@startuml UC-61
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-61.md
title UC-61: View All Reviews
footer Feature AREV-01 | Business rules: BR-07
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "OData/ReviewsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ReviewService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Open review list and choose filters\n(product, rating, visibility)
MVC -> API : GET /odata/reviews?$filter=ProductId eq {productId}\n and Rating eq {rating} and IsVisible eq {visible}\n&$orderby=CreatedAt desc&$top=20&$count=true
API -> SVC : QueryReviews()
SVC --> API : IQueryable<ReviewAdminDto> (includes hidden reviews)
API -> DB : Apply OData options and execute query
DB --> API : Matching reviews (+ total count)
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt no match
  MVC --> U : Show empty list
else reviews found
  MVC --> U : Show reviews with Show / Hide actions (UC-62)
end

@enduml
